  "body": "Improves handling of the Vinted human-verification screen without attempting to bypass it.\n\nChanges:\n- recognizes the Polish slider challenge shown as “Potwierdź, że jesteś człowiekiem” / “Przesuń w prawo, aby zabezpieczyć dostęp”\n- pauses bot actions and waits for manual completion\n- raises the default manual-verification window from 3 minutes to 10 minutes\n- supports `FLIPBOT_HUMAN_VERIFICATION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` (bounded to 60–1800 seconds)\n- requires three consecutive clean polls after the challenge disappears before resuming, avoiding mid-transition races\n- adds regression coverage for the Polish slider text\n\nNo CAPTCHA solving, slider automation, fingerprint spoofing, or new stealth mechanism is added.",
